sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as Scheduler / CLI
    participant Graph as Facebook Graph API
    participant Browser as Authenticated Playwright
    participant State as Atomic JSON state
    participant UI as Facebook UI
    participant Notify as Log / optional Telegram

    CLI->>Browser: Validate storage state and open bounded session

    loop Each scheduled cycle
    CLI->>State: Acquire exclusive flock and load / validate state

    opt Page ratings enabled — separate first step
        CLI->>Graph: Fetch Page ratings
        Graph-->>CLI: Third-party controlled rating data
        CLI->>State: Atomically deduplicate validated rating event
        opt New event contains configured Arabic keyword
            CLI->>Notify: Alert only, never enter block path
        end
    end

    CLI->>Graph: Fetch Page post IDs and optional comment IDs
    Graph-->>CLI: Content identifiers only, not reaction actors
    loop Each content object within browser-page cap
        CLI->>Browser: Scan authenticated reaction browser
        Browser-->>CLI: Label + icon-source marker + numeric profile link
        CLI->>State: Atomically deduplicate observation and target
    end

    alt Detection-only default
        CLI->>State: Leave pending targets for a later run
        CLI->>Notify: Record monitoring summary
    else Explicit --apply
        CLI->>State: Select bounded targets where status is pending
        Note over CLI,State: Includes targets created in earlier detection-only cycles
        alt No pending target selected
            CLI->>Notify: Record selected = 0; no moderation outcome update
        else Pending target or targets selected
            loop Each selected pending target
                CLI->>Browser: Reverify originating Page identity
                alt Page identity cannot be verified
                    Browser->>State: Record failed and submit nothing
                else Page identity verified
                    Browser->>UI: Confirm numeric target profile and submit block
                    UI-->>Browser: Submitted, failed, or uncertain outcome
                    Browser->>State: Atomically persist status
                end
            end
            CLI->>Notify: Optional moderation outcome summary
        end
    end
    end
